07)------------HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, on=[(time_sk@3, t_time_sk@0)], projection=[i_brand_id@0, i_brand@1, ext_price@2, t_hour@5, t_minute@6]
08)--------------CoalescePartitionsExec
09)----------------HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, on=[(i_item_sk@0, sold_item_sk@1)], projection=[i_brand_id@1, i_brand@2, ext_price@3, time_sk@5]
